    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"11814\" class=\"elementor elementor-11814\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-8797aa5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"21218\" data-id=\"8797aa5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f3d49fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f3d49fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Join Our Team</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-36f1240 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"8850\" data-id=\"36f1240\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-356fa52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"356fa52\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Family law is personal. Our clients come to us during some of the hardest moments of their lives, and they deserve a team that tells them the truth, fights when it matters, and treats them like people, not case numbers.</p><p>We&#8217;re a Lakewood family law firm built on fierce, honest, compassionate advocacy. We don&#8217;t manufacture conflict, and we don&#8217;t tolerate toxic behavior, from clients or from each other.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-ef41ff2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"12740\" data-id=\"ef41ff2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-061d29a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"061d29a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Open Positions</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-bedd987 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"85948\" data-id=\"bedd987\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-413bb82 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"413bb82\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"D0C1X6FMELV-1792012576.195059-thread-list-Thread_1792183099.342769\" aria-setsize=\"-1\"><div><div aria-roledescription=\"message\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div draggable=\"false\"><div><div><div><div><strong>Associate Attorney – Family Law</strong><br />Lakewood, CO · <span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Full-time, in-person or hybrid</span><br />3+ years Colorado family law experience  <wbr />|  <wbr />$120,000–$160,000 + quarterly bonus  <br />Applications close December 31, 2026</div></div></div></div><div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-8ecf116 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"32712\" data-id=\"8ecf116\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee36ff1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"ee36ff1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://jobs.wizehire.com/job/associate-attorney-family-law-lakewood-co-in-lakewood-colorado-us-745e67f5ea13120b\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">View &amp; Apply</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-0eafba7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"18012\" data-id=\"0eafba7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22db917 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"22db917\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Don&#8217;t see your role? We&#8217;re always glad to hear from strong paralegals and legal professionals. Send your resume to <a href=\"mailto:info@thedrakelawfirm.com\">info@thedrakelawfirm.com</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
  },
